    19	`{1, 2, 3, 5, 6, 7, ...}`, project out the additive-Fourier subspaces
    20	`V_q^prim = span{e^{2πi a n/q} : (a, q) = 1}` for each `q ≤ Q`.
    21	At Q=∞, all squarefree-conductor major arcs are removed.
    22	
    23	The Mahler measure `log m(f) := (1/2π)∫log|f(e^{iθ})| dθ` is
    24	estimated via Jensen-FFT at grid M = 4N. The Toeplitz `m_4` follows
    25	the S204 protocol (standardised entries; symmetric Toeplitz; eigenvalues
    26	scaled by `1/√N`).
